This repository contains measurement scripts and results produced on a private
DGX Spark cluster. It builds on a third-party day-0 deployment recipe:

- tonyd2wild/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4-DGX-Spark (locked serve flags, KV ladder, agent-safety stack)

Model weights are NOT included; fetch them from the Hugging Face repos listed
in the README. No model weights, datasets, or proprietary artifacts are
distributed here.
